Features of Quiz Application
User Registration & Login – Users can create accounts and securely log in.
Quiz Categories – Quizzes can be organized into subjects such as Java, Python, HTML, CSS, General Knowledge, etc.
Multiple-Choice Questions – Users can select one answer from multiple options.
Different Difficulty Levels – Includes Easy, Medium, and Hard quizzes.
Timer – A countdown timer can be used to make quizzes more challenging.
Instant Results – Users can see their score immediately after completing a quiz.
Score Tracking – Keeps track of users' previous quiz scores and performance.
Correct Answer Feedback – Displays the correct answers and helps users understand their mistakes.
Leaderboard – Allows users to compare their scores with other participants.
Responsive Design – Works smoothly on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.
Random Questions – Questions can be randomized to provide a different quiz experience each time.
User-Friendly Interface – Simple and easy-to-use design for an enjoyable learning experience.


